# The App Store Connect deliverable: 64 PNGs, ~45MB, four sizes of the same
# eight slides. Build output, not source — the editor's "Export bundle" button
# regenerates it from app-store-screenshots.json plus public/screenshots/, both
# of which are committed. The raw sim captures and the two App Previews are NOT
# ignored: re-shooting those is a full seed + capture + localize pass.
export/
.impeccable/

public/fonts/imported/*
!public/fonts/imported/.gitkeep
